        "R6"
      ],
      "text": "Check nine unloads, twelve correct releases, clerk occupied intervals, rack waits and charge use independently. Inspection already requires all thirteen minutes; the transfer clerk carries the proposed seven-minute burden. Any starvation, blocked unload invalidating timing, or incomplete correction defeats the present action."
    },
    {
